message: "If you reference this prototype, please cite it as below."
title: "Noname助手 Re:Play：面向青少年的可审计动机式访谈智能体"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Noname Re:Play Team"
version: 0.5.1
date-released: 2026-11-19
url: "https://github.com/zyi38080-ops/No_name_11_15"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  一个面向 12—18 岁青少年的游戏行为心理支持比赛原型。系统将动机式访谈
  （MI）状态机、规则与语义双层风险识别、混合知识检索和可解释的双过程策略
  规划器结合起来，输出可观察、可复盘的三天微实验，而不是直接说教或强制戒断。
keywords:
  - adolescent mental health
  - motivational interviewing
  - AI safety
  - gaming behavior
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - explainable planning
